'''Taylor Griffin''' is a senior at the University of Oklahoma. He helped lead the team with his brother, [[Blake Griffin]], to the Elite Eight of the 2009 NCAA Men's Basketball Tournament. He will most likely be entering the [[2009 NBA Draft]] Pool. Recently he was drafted by the [[Harlem Globetrotters]].

